-1.  **Compute Grid Size:** Calculate the dimensions of the voxel grid in cells:
-    $$ grid\_size = \lfloor \frac{grid\_range[3:] - grid\_range[:3]}{voxel\_size} \rfloor $$
-    Cast result to `int32` [S3, unofficial].
